<title>USA: ABC Dispensing chairman Pearlman quits.</title>
<headline>ABC Dispensing chairman Pearlman quits.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Herbert Pearlman, chairman of ABC Dispensing Technologies Inc,  said Thursday that effective Feb 5, he has resigned from the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Pearlman cited other business commitments and certain personal considerations as the reasons for leaving, but said he will serve ABC as a consultant.</p>
</text>
